  "reason": "The best result so far is config_008 (scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + transformer + weighted, acc=0.725). The evidence strongly indicates that scvi_n200 and imagenet_vit_l are the optimal encoders, transformer aggregation and weighted fusion are optimal, and multiprofile is essential. Among untested multiprofile scvi_n200 configs, config_050 (scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + avgpool + concat) retains both top encoders and represents the closest untested variant to the best configuration, differing only in aggregation and fusion. While unlikely to surpass 0.725 given the consistent performance gaps (transformer>avgpool by ~0.019, weighted>concat by ~0.004), it has the highest expected accuracy among remaining candidates and provides a final confirmation of the ranking of aggregation/fusion choices under the optimal encoder pair. As the last experiment, it maximizes the probability of confirming or marginally improving upon the current best."
}

